        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Choi Yoon-young, Ha Ji-won, Bae Doona, Sung Hoon\n- Films: Endless Flight, Horror Stories, As One\n- Television Series: Passionate Love\n- Topics: South Korean film and television\n\nFacts:\n- In 2012, Choi Yoon-young appeared in the short film \"Endless Flight,\" which was part of the omnibus film \"Horror Stories.\"\n- In 2012, Choi Yoon-young also appeared in the table tennis sports film \"As One.\"\n- \"As One\" is a 2012 South Korean sports drama film starring Ha Ji-won and Bae Doona.\n- \"Passionate Love\" is a 2013 South Korean weekend television drama series starring Sung Hoon and Choi Yoon-young.",
